### list addresses

GET {{baseUrl}}

### get address by id

GET {{baseUrl}}/{{addressId}}

### update address

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{addressId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "location": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/Ly51Sz3Zp5JpLqyS9",
    "region": "Al-batinah",
    "city": "AboAbali"
}

### delete address

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{addressId}}

